---
import '../styles/global.css' 
import Header from '../components/header.astro'
---
<!-- bg-[url('billeder/rulle.png')] bg-cover bg-fixed -->

<body class="m-0 ">
    <Header/>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-4 grid-rows-61 p-5">

        <!-- baggrunds gif -->
        <div class="z-5 row-start-3 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-12 place-self-center">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/pretty.gif" class="saturate-100 w-300">
        </div>

        <div class="z-2 row-start-3 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-8">
            <img src="/billeder/musikvideo/hvid.jpg" class="w-180 blur-3xl">
        </div>
        <div class="z-0 row-start-3 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-10">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/graa.png" class="w-180 blur-3xl hue-rotate-90 contrast-10">
        </div>
        <div class="z-0 row-start-6 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-8">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/graa.png" class="w-180 blur-3xl hue-rotate-90 contrast-10">
        </div>
        <div class="z-0 row-start-9 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-8">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/graa.png" class="w-180 blur-3xl hue-rotate-90 contrast-10">
        </div>
        <div class="z-0 row-start-11 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-8">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/graa.png" class="w-180 blur-3xl hue-rotate-90 contrast-10">
        </div>
        <div class="z-2 row-start-8 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-8">
            <img src="/billeder/musikvideo/hvid.jpg" class="w-180 blur-3xl">
        </div>



        <!-- tribal divider -->
		<div class="z-5 row-start-15 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-2 place-self-center">
			<img src="http://dl.glitter-graphics.net/pub/621/621641xy2arhaa2t.gif" width=300 height=111>
		</div>
        
        <div class="z-20 row-start-6 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-6">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-center text-blue-600 text-[120px] hyphens-auto" lang="en">
                I also do live visuals and this is from CPH:DOX
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="z-0 row-start-16 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-8">
            <img src="/billeder/musikvideo/hvid.jpg" class="w-200 blur-3xl">
        </div>
        <div class="z-10 row-start-17 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-4">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[40px] hyphens-auto">
                I've been doing live visuals since my stay at Engelsholm Hoejskole in the spring of 2021.
                <br> 
                <br> this is my creative playground.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="z-10 row-start-20 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-2">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-blue-600 text-[130px]">
                let's partii<span class="text-cyan-300">iiiii</span>ii!
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="z-8 row-start-18 col-start-3 col-span-2 row-span-3 place-self-center pr-7">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/hahamig2.gif" class="saturate-200 w-50">
        </div>
        <div class="z-10 row-start-22 col-start-2 col-span-3 row-span-2">
            <p class="font-serif text-cyan-300 bg-pink-600 text-[40px] hyphens-auto">
                I got hired to do visuals at two parties hosted by CPH:DOX
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="z-10 row-start-23 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-3">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[40px] hyphens-auto" lang="en">
                I had total creative freedom, so I decided to match the theme of the visuals, 
                <br> to the theme & aesthetics of the 
                <br> documentary <span class="font-bold italic">"Jaripeo"</span>, that had 
                <br> just premiered.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="z-0 row-start-26 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-5 saturate-200">
            <video autoplay muted loop controls class="border-5 border-pink-600">
                <source src="/billeder/cphdox/charlottenborg1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
        </div>

        <div class="z-10 row-start-31 col-start-1 col-span-2 row-span-2">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[40px] hyphens-auto">
                the visuals were personal, sensual, confrontational, colorful, shiny, engaging, funny & loud.
            </p>
        </div>
        <!-- MLP -->
         <div class="z-10 row-start-31 col-start-3 col-span-2 row-span-3">
            <img class="saturate-200" src="http://dl4.glitter-graphics.net/pub/1176/1176934fnbulcyxto.gif" width=645 height=452>
         </div>

        <div class="z-2 row-start-32 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-8">
            <img src="/billeder/musikvideo/hvid.jpg" class="w-180 blur-3xl">
        </div>

        <div class="z-8 row-start-33 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-3 place-self-center">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/girlgallop.gif">
        </div>
        
        <div class="z-8 row-start-36 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-3 place-self-center">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/horsies.gif" class="saturate-150">
        </div>

        <div class="z-8 row-start-39 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-3 place-self-center">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/oejne.gif" class="saturate-150">
        </div>

        <div class="z-8 row-start-42 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-3 place-self-center">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/BWmig.gif" class="saturate-150">
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-46 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-3">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[40px] hyphens-auto" lang="en">
                to make it even MORE fun, I aimed my iphone camera at the crowd, the dj 
                <br> & myself broadcasting them on the big screen, creating fierce moments of 
                <br> self expression.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="z-0 row-start-49 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-5 saturate-200">
            <video autoplay muted loop controls class="border-5 border-pink-600">
                <source src="/billeder/cphdox/liveeee2.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-54 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-4">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-blue-600 text-[80px] hyphens-auto" lang="en">
                i love my job, 
                <br> it's so colorful 
                <br> & i'm a great 
                <br> visual curator
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- enhjørning -->
        <!-- <div class="row-start-57 col-start-2 col-span-3 row-span-4 place-self-center">
            <img src="http://dl5.glitter-graphics.net/pub/1733/1733695fs2j1vsuhw.gif" width=400 height=400>
        </div> -->

        <div class="z-8 row-start-58 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-3 place-self-center pl-40">
            <img src="/billeder/cphdox/lol.gif" class="saturate-150 border-5 border-blue-600">
        </div>





    </div>



</body>